WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:22.782
"Oops," Ben said as black vapor drifted from his pond scum soup.

2
00:00:22.783 --> 00:00:28.550
It was Monday morning, and Ben was stuck in his least favorite class.

3
00:00:28.551 --> 00:00:34.362
Cooking was boring, and Ben was terrible at it.

4
00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:40.400
Winnie looked over from her workstation. "Ben, your soup is smoking."

5
00:00:40.401 --> 00:00:42.708
"Yeah, I know."

6
00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:47.319
She wrinkled her nose. "What did you put in it?"

7
00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:50.295
Ben looked at all the jars on his counter.

8
00:00:50.296 --> 00:00:56.128
He saw dried lizard toes, rat tails, and several other items.

9
00:00:56.129 --> 00:01:01.557
He shrugged. "Honestly, I don't remember what I put in it."

10
00:01:01.558 --> 00:01:06.156
Winnie burst out laughing, and Ben joined in.

11
00:01:06.157 --> 00:01:10.891
The only good thing about Cooking class was that Winnie was in it.

12
00:01:10.892 --> 00:01:13.978
Mr. Icky pointed one of his tentacles at them.

13
00:01:13.979 --> 00:01:17.013
"What are you two laughing about?"

14
00:01:17.014 --> 00:01:19.828
"Uh, nothing," Ben said.

15
00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:24.027
Suddenly—Boom! Splat!

16
00:01:24.028 --> 00:01:27.154
"Oh, man!" Mog cried.

17
00:01:27.155 --> 00:01:29.984
Everyone turned to see what had happened.

18
00:01:29.985 --> 00:01:32.361
Green soup covered Mog.

19
00:01:32.362 --> 00:01:37.968
It dripped down his face and shirt, forming a puddle on the floor.

20
00:01:37.969 --> 00:01:46.162
A zombie who was staggering by slipped and fell.

21
00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:51.834
As Mog began to clean up the mess, the zombie just lay there.

22
00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:55.919
"Is that zombie going to get up?" Ben asked.

23
00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:58.534
"Eventually," Winnie said.

24
00:01:58.535 --> 00:02:04.876
Mog gritted his teeth. "I hate cooking!"

25
00:02:04.877 --> 00:02:08.487
"Now, now." Mr. Icky slid over to help.

26
00:02:08.488 --> 00:02:11.089
"We all make mistakes."

27
00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.567
"Poor Mog," Winnie whispered.

28
00:02:13.568 --> 00:02:18.482
"Poor me," Ben said. His soup had stopped smoking.

29
00:02:18.483 --> 00:02:21.858
Now it was making a strange humming sound.

30
00:02:21.859 --> 00:02:26.105
"Ooh!" Winnie's eyes went wide.

31
00:02:26.106 --> 00:02:32.131
"That sounds like the cute monster in the movie we saw last weekend."

32
00:02:32.132 --> 00:02:39.511
Ben smiled. He and Winnie had gone on a double date with Mog and Deb.

33
00:02:39.512 --> 00:02:42.895
They had seen a romantic monster movie.

34
00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:47.872
Mog complained during the whole movie because there were no explosions.

35
00:02:47.873 --> 00:02:51.116
But Ben kind of liked the movie.

36
00:02:51.117 --> 00:02:53.841
He didn't tell Mog that though.

37
00:02:53.842 --> 00:02:58.988
A three-eyed monster sprinkled something into her soup.

38
00:02:58.989 --> 00:03:03.505
"That smells wonderful!" a four-eyed monster said.

39
00:03:03.506 --> 00:03:05.534
"What did you put in it?"

40
00:03:05.535 --> 00:03:10.447
"Oh, just some rotten fungus flakes," the three-eyed monster said.

41
00:03:10.448 --> 00:03:13.799
Other monsters smiled as they stirred their soups.

42
00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:18.612
The pleasant smell of dirt and rotten vegetables filled the room.

43
00:03:18.613 --> 00:03:20.813
"Ugh," Ben mumbled.

44
00:03:20.814 --> 00:03:26.336
"Everyone's soup looks fine except for mine. I wish this class were over."

45
00:03:26.337 --> 00:03:29.475
"So," Winnie said without looking up.

46
00:03:29.476 --> 00:03:33.351
She was skimming some dead leaves from her soup.

47
00:03:33.352 --> 00:03:36.263
"Are there any plans for Saturday night?"

48
00:03:36.264 --> 00:03:41.909
Ben shot a quick look at Winnie. "Um, I don't know. Why?"

49
00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:46.422
"Uh, hello," Winnie said. "It's my birthday."

50
00:03:46.423 --> 00:03:49.987
"Oh, really?" Ben ran a hand through his hair.

51
00:03:49.988 --> 00:03:54.471
"I had no idea!

52
00:03:54.472 --> 00:03:57.261
I guess we should plan something, right?"

53
00:03:57.262 --> 00:04:00.847
Winnie gave Ben a suspicious look.

54
00:04:00.848 --> 00:04:04.372
"Gaby asked me to go to Monster Mall on Saturday afternoon.

55
00:04:04.373 --> 00:04:08.074
But that's weird because Gaby hates shopping.

56
00:04:08.075 --> 00:04:12.411
So I started to think that maybe you're all planning a party."

57
00:04:12.412 --> 00:04:16.099
She met Ben's eyes and stared at him.

58
00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:20.698
Ben looked away and pretended to read the label on a spice jar.

59
00:04:20.699 --> 00:04:24.235
Winnie could sometimes tell what someone was thinking.

60
00:04:24.236 --> 00:04:27.686
"Maybe Gaby just wants to buy you a birthday present."

61
00:04:27.687 --> 00:04:30.536
"Everyone, it's time to stop cooking!"

62
00:04:30.537 --> 00:04:33.455
Mr. Icky said before Winnie could reply.

63
00:04:33.456 --> 00:04:36.441
"We'll do a quick tasting before we clean up.

64
00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:40.025
Who wants to let us taste their soup first?"

65
00:04:40.026 --> 00:04:43.843
Several monsters raised their hands and claws.

66
00:04:43.844 --> 00:04:46.987
Ben gazed down at his soup and frowned.

67
00:04:46.988 --> 00:04:49.638
"Mine looks terrible," he thought.

68
00:04:49.639 --> 00:04:52.883
"Nobody will want to taste it."

69
00:04:52.884 --> 00:04:58.445
He quietly floated over to the trash can and dumped his soup.

70
00:04:58.446 --> 00:05:01.735
After class Ben was at his locker.

71
00:05:01.736 --> 00:05:05.180
Waldo poked his head out of a nearby classroom.

72
00:05:05.181 --> 00:05:10.797
"Psst, Ben!" he whispered. "Come here!"

73
00:05:10.798 --> 00:05:14.588
Ben went in, and Waldo closed the door behind him.

74
00:05:14.589 --> 00:05:18.875
Gaby, Deb, Mog, and some other monsters were there.

75
00:05:18.876 --> 00:05:21.275
"Quick meeting," Waldo said.

76
00:05:21.276 --> 00:05:24.787
"We need to discuss Winnie's surprise party."

77
00:05:24.788 --> 00:05:27.824
"She almost figured it out," Ben said.

78
00:05:27.825 --> 00:05:31.024
"I pretended to not know about any party."

79
00:05:31.025 --> 00:05:35.963
"That's good," Mog said. "Now it will be a real surprise!"

80
00:05:35.964 --> 00:05:38.062
Waldo pushed his glasses up.

81
00:05:38.063 --> 00:05:40.877
"Everyone knows what the plan is, right?"

82
00:05:40.878 --> 00:05:45.441
Gaby nodded. "I'm taking Winnie to Monster Mall on Saturday afternoon.

83
00:05:45.442 --> 00:05:47.627
We'll be back at her house by six o'clock."

84
00:05:47.628 --> 00:05:53.742
Deb spoke up. "While you two are at the mall, we'll set up for the party in Winnie's house."

85
00:05:53.743 --> 00:05:56.865
Everyone started discussing decorations and food.

86
00:05:56.866 --> 00:05:59.338
But Ben wasn't paying much attention.

87
00:05:59.339 --> 00:06:02.386
He was excited about Winnie's birthday.

88
00:06:02.387 --> 00:06:07.663
However, there was one big problem: he didn't know what to get for her.

89
00:06:07.664 --> 00:06:14.945
He'd thought about possible gifts for weeks, but so far he hadn't come up with any good ideas.

90
00:06:14.946 --> 00:06:18.501
"I still have five days," he told himself.

91
00:06:18.502 --> 00:06:22.903
"I'll find the perfect gift before the party."
